# The modern spruce A on a probe (reports/content/2026-11-trees/fir/README.md, «Модель»): five spruces of 14 to
# 22 m along the north edge of the meadow east of the tavern, 5 to 8 m south of the original's firs, built by
# scripts/content/fir_set.py probe; run with OPENGOTHIC_CONTENT=<that set>. Stills only, at noon, each in the calm
# after a gust. The noon sun stands in the west (-x), 57 degrees high: the cameras look north-east, the sun to
# their left and a little behind.
#   row    from the meadow's south-west corner, 6 m over spruce A's root: the five spruces and the firs behind;
#   far    the same place, 30 m from spruce A (seed 7, 18 m), the eye 1.7 m over the ground;
#   near   9.5 m from its trunk, 5 m from its lower boughs;
#   close  6.5 m from the trunk, 2 m from the skirt, up into the lower tiers.
# The cameras stand by PROBE of the script: change both together. Elsewhere the meadow's views are taken: the
# crowns of the original's trees at (42681, -352) and (41111, -2898) are 30 m wide, and from the south-east the
# spruces stand against the sun.
#   OPENGOTHIC_CONTENT=<set> TEMPEST_WINDOW_SIZE=2560x1440 BENCH_HOST=ryzen scripts/bench.sh fir-probe
# @timeout 600
seed 73013
cheat god
overlay off
ui off
view full
set time 12 0

# the hero stands behind the first two views
goto pos 39400 3790 -2000
clear 3000
streaming wait
grass wait
cam at 39550 3946 -1820 39900 4150 1150
wait 5000
foliage wait-lull 1500 0
wait 1500
shot row
wait 200

cam at 39550 3946 -1820 41250 4210 650
wait 2000
foliage wait-lull 1500 0
wait 1500
shot far
wait 200

goto pos 40550 3420 -350
streaming wait
grass wait
cam at 40710 3580 -130 41250 3725 650
wait 4000
foliage wait-lull 1500 0
wait 1500
shot near
wait 200

cam at 40880 3555 115 41250 3775 650
wait 2000
foliage wait-lull 1500 0
wait 1500
shot close
wait 200
